{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261116/photo/bkn-20261116230421455-1116_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261116230956\"/><p>其中一批被捕女子。</p><p>跨部門人員今日（16日）在元朗區展開代號「火石」打擊非法賣淫活動行動，共拘捕28名內地女子，年齡介乎17至48歲，涉嫌「違反逗留條件」。所有被捕女子現正被扣留調查。部門呼籲市民，若發現區內有懷疑非法活動，請與執法部門聯絡。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T15:39:52.954416+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T15:04:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T15:53:29.501919+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T15:33:14.212892+00:00","content_hash":"ff84e4e16ed982b7dfd55fe3c056ebf80187ee3b765b754218a94fa4b987b9bd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T15:39:52.954416+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}